# landmarks: fairy lights over the village, the giant snow globe with its igloos, the igloo corner, the crystal-cave
# arches, the rink snowman, penguin sleds on the snowman lane (F5 traffic fallback), the chapel
PROP kind=fairy_lights at=(20.0,-0.3,0.0) yaw=-90 scale=1
